    Start --> Scan
    Scan --> Found
    Found -->|あり| UserInit
    Found -->|なし| CheckID
    UserInit --> UserSuccess
    UserSuccess -->|成功| GetInfo
    UserSuccess -->|失敗| StdInit
    StdInit --> StdSuccess
    StdSuccess -->|成功| GetInfo
    StdSuccess -->|失敗| OtherDevice
    OtherDevice -->|あり| StdInit
    OtherDevice -->|なし| CheckID
    GetInfo --> Register
    Register --> CheckID
    CheckID -->|あり| Scan
    CheckID -->|なし| End
    end

